Preview updates with `lenso code preview auth`. Change a store explicitly with
`lenso code preview auth --input '{"bindings":{"auth.store":{"type":"module","module":"postgres"}}}'`
and apply the reviewed plan using `lenso code add auth` with the same input.
Project provider defaults do not replace an installed store. Switching adapters
preserves database files and records; applications own data conversion.
